WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.640
At the circle, there isn't a problem that we cannot solve. We have cameras in place all over the world right now.

00:00:06.009 --> 00:00:08.009
Terrorists can no longer hide.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.580
Where does all that data go?

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:14.520
Everything is stored and analyzed here. They could use it however they see fit.

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:16.440
I want the truth.

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:18.360
Did you think this was just a camera?

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:21.080
I'm the only one who can do this.

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.640
Most of the things we hide can get us in trouble. We can't be here.

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:26.430
So May, is there anything you want to tell us?

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.760
The Circle, April 28th.

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:35.399
I am a believer in the perfectibility of human beings.

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:39.450
At the circle, we can finally realize our potential.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.661
When we are our best selves, there isn't a problem that we cannot solve.

00:00:44.661 --> 00:00:47.639
We can cure any disease and we can end hunger.

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:50.309
Imagine the human rights implications.

00:00:50.829 --> 00:00:52.829
The possibilities are endless.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:01:01.379
Your payment, it was for $78.13 and the bill was for $78.31? Thank you.

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:04.710
You got the job at The Circle.

00:01:05.590 --> 00:01:09.510
Have a drink, have a good time and stay excited. You're at The Circle.

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:13.040
Hello May, how are you? Darren here will be doing your training.

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:16.700
When I first started, it took me a few weeks to really get the hang of it. Believe me, you're doing fine.

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:18.320
You should come visit me at work some time.

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:20.160
You might think I was there to clean the toilets.

00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:23.140
Everyone really likes you.

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:27.080
Your work's been exemplary, strong ratings but your absence at several events.

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:30.280
Sorry, my dad had an episode and I was home helping out.

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:31.720
Is that related to his MS?

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:34.579
I've been looking into your parents situation

00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:35.550
and I have an idea.

00:01:35.550 --> 00:01:38.980
So I was thinking it would make sense for an ace folks to come on the circle health plan.

00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:41.800
I want to see how much I value what you've done for my family.

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:43.760
May, you're a valued part of the circle.

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:46.100
We care about everybody you care about.

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:50.840
May's only been with us for a few months, but she has made quite an impression.

00:01:52.740 --> 00:01:56.659
So May, do you think you behave better or worse when you are being watched?

00:01:57.420 --> 00:02:00.230
We have cameras in place all over the world right now.

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:04.940
We used to go on adventures.

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:11.119
We used to have fun and see things and now it's all filtered through this. Does this really seem okay to you?

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:16.340
I didn't create this. This is not what I had in mind.

00:02:19.409 --> 00:02:21.438
Things at the circle, they need to change.

00:02:23.570 --> 00:02:27.699
Everything recorded, seen, broadcast. They're stored and analysed here.

00:02:27.699 --> 00:02:31.479
They could use it however they see fit. No matter what it's cost.

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:38.360
Knowing is good

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:41.280
but knowing everything is better.

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:46.049
So May, is there anything you want to tell us?

